			&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/trump-iran-war-ceasefire-strikes-c45111ed270afa7dac285016ce07362f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Trump says he no longer wants a deal with Iran as U.S. resumes its attacks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
