			&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/iran-us-war-strait-of-hormuz-july-1-2026-de0729197bc7b9d3ee9e543d94c18fbe&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;US and Iran agree (through mediators) to continue discussions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
