&lt;section&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;tangerine&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;font-size:4em;padding:1.2rem 0px;&quot;&gt;Impeach. Convict. Remove.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Recap of this week in the revolution: Hegseth&amp;#39;s Congressional hearing and DOJ weaponized against Comey (again). Supreme Court guts the Voting Rights Act and Trump tells ABC to fire Kimmel (again). DHS funded but no money for ICE and Trump regime paying companies to abandon green energy contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
