                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnn.com/2026/04/30/politics/dhs-shutdown-funding-bill-house-vote&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(CNN) Congress votes to reopen key parts of DHS without ICE funding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
