				&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/rep-cherfilus-mccormick-resigns-ahead-of-ethics-probe-into-use-of-campaign-funds&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(PBS) Rep. Cherfilus-McCormick resigns ahead of ethics probe into use of campaign funds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
