				&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/middle-east/trump-kharg-island-iran-energy-strikes-israel-b2948841.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(The Independent) Trump&#39;s new ultimatum to Iran: Make a deal soon or we&#39;ll obliterate Kharg Island&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/while-trump-vows-iran-deal-on-the-way-evidence-points-to-another-direction&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(France24) While Trump vows Iran deal on the way, &quot;evidence points to another direction&quot;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
