&lt;section&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;tangerine&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;font-size:4em;padding:1.2rem 0px;&quot;&gt;Impeach. Convict. Remove.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Recap of this week in the revolution: Trump regime scraps plan to protect civilians then spends $11bn in first 6 days of war. U.S. bombs elementary school killing 160, mostly children, while Trump sons engage in blatant profiteering. Join No Kings Day #3 on March 28.&lt;/p&gt;
